00:08:46.815 --> 00:08:48.475
Oh my goodness.

00:08:48.475 --> 00:08:50.630
Wow. What a great demonstration.

00:08:50.630 --> 00:08:53.590
Yeah. Just changing the
order makes a big difference.

00:08:53.590 --> 00:08:55.830
And you mentioned the
moon and the earth.

00:08:55.830 --> 00:08:57.590
That's one of
your assignments?

00:08:57.590 --> 00:08:59.090
-Yeah. Yep.

00:08:59.090 --> 00:09:00.590
You can parent motion.

00:09:00.590 --> 00:09:03.030
So if I took the say the
earth and the earth is slowly

00:09:03.030 --> 00:09:04.965
